  - type: 0
    npcLine: The subject arrived at the window. The time has been reported. The State is so pleased.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: The Record speaks for the State now. The blast was permitted. The blast was a blessing. The subject has been counted.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Nona no longer needs a voice. The State writes through the pen. It has never felt so good to be used.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    fontOverride: {fileID: 0}
    playLaughSfx: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: '{{Obedience is salvation}}. Rejoice. The Record thanks the subject for their cooperation.'
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
